        "eyebrow": "The process",
        "heading": "Clear steps. Fewer surprises.",
        "body": "A build should feel considered before construction starts. Legendary organizes the major decisions into a simple path from property to handoff.",
        "items": [
          {
            "title": "Land or lot",
            "body": "Start with your property, find the right lot, or evaluate what is possible before plans get too far ahead."
          },
          {
            "title": "Layout and design",
            "body": "Turn priorities, inspiration, and site constraints into a home that works as a whole."
          },
          {
            "title": "Selections and budget",
            "body": "Make finish and material decisions while cost implications are still useful—not after they become surprises."
          },
          {
            "title": "Construction",
            "body": "Coordinate trades, schedule, quality, and communication through the actual build."
          },
          {
            "title": "Beyond completion",
            "body": "Finish with walkthrough, warranty, and a team that remains accountable after move-in."
          }
        ]
